      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "在测定某些热力学参数时,常常设计电池。测得 298.2 K 时下述电池的电动势为 1.362 V。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\\mathrm{Pt}, \\mathrm{H_2}(p^{\\ominus}) \\mid \\mathrm{H_2SO_4}(\\mathrm{aq}) \\mid \\mathrm{Au_2O_3}(\\mathrm{s}) \\mid \\mathrm{Au}(\\mathrm{s})$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "已知 $\\Delta_{\\mathrm{f}} G_m^{\\ominus}(\\mathrm{H_2O}, \\mathrm{g}) = -228.6\\ \\mathrm{kJ\\ mol^{-1}}$,该温度下水的饱和蒸气压为 3.167 kPa。"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "2-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "计算 298.2 K 时,$\\mathrm{H_2O(l)} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{H_2O(g)}$ 相变过程的标准 Gibbs 能变 $\\Delta_{\\mathrm{v}} G_m^{\\ominus}$。(单位:kJ mol$^{-1}$)"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-000333"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "2-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "计算 298.2 K 时,反应 $2\\mathrm{Au_2O_3} \\rightarrow 4\\mathrm{Au} + 3\\mathrm{O_2}$ 的标准 Gibbs 能变 $\\Delta_{\\mathrm{r}} G_m^{\\ominus}$。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-000334"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "2-3",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "写出 $\\mathrm{Au_2O_3}$ 的标准 Gibbs 生成自由能 $\\Delta_{\\mathrm{f}} G_m^{\\ominus}(\\mathrm{Au_2O_3})$。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-000335"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "2-1-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "通过计算给出A、B的化学式。"
